*** Keywords ***
General_SiSo_Auto_NR_UL_Test_Model_Activation_Admin
    [Documentation]
    ...  NR Uplink Test Model using admin API. Version for TDD and FDD radios.
    ...  Additional DL test model is started in case when cell technology is TDD.
    ...  *Before validations, the initial results are removed; by default, the first measurement is removed.*
    ...  |    | Performed Validations |
    ...  | 1. | If the reporting time interval is correct across all measurements. Additional check not from QC |
    ...  | 2. | If the RSSI values are within the specified deviation, default is 3dB. |
    ...  | 3. | If the sum of unreceived and defective blocks is constant across all measurements. \
    ...         - *allowed percentage of sum values that can be incorrect is 5% by default.* |
    ...  | 4. | If the sum of unreceived and defective blocks corresponds to the number of uplink slots in the \
    ...         measurement interval. |
    ...  | 5. | If the sum of unreceived and defective bits is constant across all measurements. \
    ...         - *allowed percentage of sum values that can be incorrect is 5% by default.* |
    ...  | 6. | If the sum of unreceived and defective bits corresponds to the number of transmitted bits in the \
    ...         measurement interval. |
    ...  If any of the requirements is not met, the test will fail.
    ...
    ...  :param int cell_id (Mandatory): Global cell id of tested NR cell.
    ...  :param str/list frc_index (Mandatory): One of following NR UL test models supported for cell configuration e.g.:
    ...                                         "G-FR1-A1-1", "G-FR1-A1-4", "G-FR1-A1-7",
    ...                                         "G-FR1-A2-1", "G-FR1-A2-4"
    ...                             It's possible to run many test models at once on tested cell by giving argument test_model as list of strings.
    ...                             In Robot Framework structure it's required to create list before starting Test Case, then pass the list
    ...                             as test_model parameter, e.g. :
    ...                             @{frc_indexes}=         Create List                    G-FR1-A1-1  G-FR1-A1-2  G-FR1-A2-4
    ...                             General_SiSo_Auto_UL_Test_Model_Verification_Admin     frc_index=${frc_indexes}
    ...  :param int rep_time_interval (Optional): reporting time interval (in seconds), range <0 to 4294967295>, default 1.
    ...  :param str ru_mode (Optional): RU mode [NR_Only | Customize_1 | MSR] default NR_Only.
    ...  :param int prb_offset (Optional): PRB offset, range <0 to 272>, default 0.
    ...  :param int/list beam_pattern_id (Optional): parameter beamPatternId, range <0 to 1200>, default 0.
    ...  :param str dl_test_model (Optional): DL test model, default NR-FR1-TM1.1.
    ...  :param int test_duration (Optional): (in seconds) duration of the test model in seconds, default 30.
    ...  :param int timeout (Optional): (in seconds) for test model startup, and termination operations, default 30.
    ...  :param int ul_slots (Optional): number of uplink slots, default value depends on the cell technology, 10 for FDD and 4 for TDD.
    ...  :param int initial_measurements_to_remove (Optional): number of initial measurements to remove, default 1.
    ...  :param str admin_test_model_ul (Optional): name of NR Uplink Test Model visible when checked via admin API.
    ...  :param str admin_test_model_dl (Optional): name of NR Downlink Test Model visible when checked via admin API.

    [Arguments]  ${cell_id}
    ...          ${frc_index}
    ...          ${rep_time_interval}=1
    ...          ${ru_mode}=NR_Only
    ...          ${prb_offset}=0
    ...          ${beam_pattern_id}=0
    ...          ${dl_test_model}=NR-FR1-TM1.1
    ...          ${test_duration}=30
    ...          ${timeout}=30
    ...          ${ul_slots}=${None}
    ...          ${initial_measurements_to_remove}=1
    ...          ${admin_test_name_ul}=NR_UPLINK
    ...          ${admin_test_name_dl}=NR_DOWNLINK
    [Timeout]    24 hours

    ${connection}                                           connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ${cell_dist_names}  ${physical_cell_id}                 Get Cell Info for Performance Test
    ...                                                     config_nr_cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ${cell_technology}=                                     admin_info_model.get_cell_technology
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     cell_type=nr
    ...                                                     cell_id=${cell_id}
    ${ul_slots}                  run keyword if             '${ul_slots}'=='${None}'
    ...                                                     tm_setup_adm.get_default_ul_slots_value
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                          ELSE                       set variable
    ...                                                     ${ul_slots}
    &{nrarfcn}=                                             tm_setup_adm.get_nrafcn_variables_for_nr_cell_id
    ...                                                     cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     sep_channels_for_tdd=${True}

    @{frc_indexes_list}                                     tm_startup.create_test_models_list
    ...                                                     test_model=${frc_index}
    
    Robot Log Operation                                     Performing the following NR Uplink test types: ${frc_indexes_list}
    FOR    ${frc_index}    IN                               @{frc_indexes_list}
        Run Keyword If                                      '${cell_technology}'=='TDD'
        ...                                                 Start NR Downlink Before Uplink Test Model
        ...                                                 connection=${connection}
        ...                                                 cell_distname=${cell_dist_names["run_time"]}
        ...                                                 test_model=${dl_test_model}
        ...                                                 cell_id=${cell_id}
        ...                                                 physical_cell_id=${physical_cell_id}
        ...                                                 nrarfcn_dl=${nrarfcn['nrarfcn_downlink']}
        ...                                                 nrarfcn_ul=${nrarfcn['nrarfcn_uplink']}
        ...                                                 admin_test_name_dl=${admin_test_name_dl}
        
        Start NR Uplink Test Model                          connection=${connection}
        ...                                                 cell_distname=${cell_dist_names["run_time"]}  
        ...                                                 frc_index=${frc_index}
        ...                                                 nrarfcn_dl=${nrarfcn['nrarfcn_downlink']}
        ...                                                 nrarfcn_ul=${nrarfcn['nrarfcn_uplink']}
        ...                                                 physical_cell_id=${physical_cell_id}
        ...                                                 rep_time_interval=${rep_time_interval}
        ...                                                 ru_mode=${ru_mode}
        ...                                                 prb_offset=${prb_offset}
        ...                                                 beam_pattern_id=${beam_pattern_id}
        ...                                                 timeout=${timeout}
        
        Check If Test Model Is Active                       admin_test_name=${admin_test_name_ul}
        ...                                                 cell_id=${cell_id}
        ...                                                 connection=${connection}

        ${results}=                                         Collect NR Uplink Test Results
        ...                                                 cell_distname=${cell_dist_names["run_time"]}
        ...                                                 frc_index=${frc_index}
        ...                                                 connection=${connection}
        ...                                                 test_duration=${test_duration}

        Run Keyword If                                      '${cell_technology}'=='TDD'
        ...                                                 Stop NR Downlink Test Model
        ...                                                 connection=${connection}
        ...                                                 cell_distname=${cell_dist_names["run_time"]}
        ...                                                 test_model=${dl_test_model}
        ...                                                 admin_test_name=${admin_test_name_dl}
        Stop NR Uplink Test Model                           connection=${connection}                                
        ...                                                 cell_distname=${cell_dist_names["run_time"]}
        ...                                                 frc_index=${frc_index}
        ...                                                 admin_test_name=${admin_test_name_ul}

        Verify NR Uplink Test Results                       results=${results}
        ...                                                 uplink_slots=${ul_slots}
        ...                                                 rep_time_interval=${rep_time_interval}
        ...                                                 frc_index=${frc_index}
        ...                                                 initial_measurements_to_remove=${initial_measurements_to_remove}

        Robot Log Step                                      Successfully executed ${frc_index} Test Model!\n
    END
    Robot Log Step                                          All NR Uplink Test Models have finished successfully.
    
    [Teardown]                                              NR Uplink Test Model Teardown
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     cell_distname=${cell_dist_names["run_time"]}
    ...                                                     frc_index=${frc_index}
    ...                                                     dl_test_model=${dl_test_model}
    ...                                                     admin_test_name_ul=${admin_test_name_ul}
    ...                                                     admin_test_name_dl=${admin_test_name_dl}


NR Uplink Test Model Teardown
    [Documentation]  Terminates NR Uplink Test Model and checks if any Test Model is active.
    [Arguments]      ${connection}
    ...              ${cell_distname}
    ...              ${frc_index}
    ...              ${dl_test_model}
    ...              ${admin_test_name_ul}
    ...              ${admin_test_name_dl}

    ${active_tests}                                         tm_common_adm.get_active_tests
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ${active_tests}                                         Evaluate  [test['testInfo'] for test in ${active_tests}]
    Run Keyword If                                          '${admin_test_name_dl}' in ${active_tests}
    ...                                                     Stop NR Downlink Test Model
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     cell_distname=${cell_distname}
    ...                                                     test_model=${dl_test_model}
    ...                                                     admin_test_name=${admin_test_name_dl}
    Run Keyword If                                          '${admin_test_name_ul}' in ${active_tests}
    ...                                                     Stop NR Uplink Test Model
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     cell_distname=${cell_distname}
    ...                                                     frc_index=${frc_index}
    ...                                                     admin_test_name=${admin_test_name_ul}
    Check If Any Test Model Is Active                       should_be_active=${False}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}


